# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values from your Supabase
# project's Settings -> API page. Never commit .env.local.
#
# Both variables here are PUBLIC (browser-exposed) by design — they are safe
# to ship to the client. Row Level Security in Postgres is the real
# authorization boundary, not secrecy of these values. The Supabase
# secret/service-role key is NOT used anywhere in this app and must never be
# added here or to any NEXT_PUBLIC_* variable.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
